      "title": "Photoquip (India) Limited Appoints Aishwarya Anil Lokhare as Company Secretary and Compliance Officer, Effective January 5, 2026",
      "body": "Photoquip (India) Limited, based on the recommendation of the Nomination and Remuneration Committee, has appointed Ms. Aishwarya Anil Lokhare as Company Secretary and Compliance Officer of the Company with effect from January 5, 2026. Ms. Aishwarya Anil Lokhare has also been designated as Key Managerial Personnel of the Company with effect from January 5, 2026. Ms. Aishwarya Anil Lokhare is a qualified Company Secretary. She holds experience in the field of Secretarial compliances of listed companies, private companies and public unlisted companies. Ms. Aishwarya Anil Lokhare is ACS having membership number A79455. The Board of Directors of the Company considered and approved the appointment at their meeting held on January 5, 2026.",
